    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "makes sense. if we see symptoms of deficiency in the vineyard (like interveinal chlorosis), what's the best way to address it? should we be looking at soil amendments or foliar sprays to get those levels back up? i want to give the client some concrete options.",
      "source": "evaluator"
